{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>3793</strong></span>亿！</span><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">2022年京东618</span><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">累计下单金额再突破</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #ff0000; font-size: 16px;\">一体化供应链物流彰显超强韧性</span></strong><br/><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #ff0000; font-size: 16px;\">全面保障消费体验与产业效率升级</span></strong><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">助力企业、行业、社会</span><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">实现<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>确定性、高质量增长</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">全国<strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">94%</span></strong>区县、<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>84%</strong></span>乡镇</span><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">实现当日或次日达</span><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">国际供应链网络触达近<strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">230个</span></strong>国家和地区</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\">在重拾“烟火气”的上海</span><br/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000; font-size: 16